      "id": "verbal-irony",
      "text": "Verbal irony — saying the opposite of what is meant in order to mock or deflate",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "rationale": "The admission “I could not see her” is sincere and confessional, not a surface-level statement masking its opposite for satirical effect."
